{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Enso 是一款專為個人日記與心情記錄而設的應用工具，適合希望養成書寫習慣、整理思緒或進行感恩練習的使用者。它提供簡潔無干擾的寫作介面，並支援情緒追蹤與標籤分類，讓每日反思更有條理。目前原價 US $0.99，正在限時免費，正是下載體驗的好時機。</p>\n\n<h2>日記與情緒管理工具</h2>\n<p>Enso 讓你輕鬆記錄每日想法，搭配乾淨專注的寫作環境，不受多餘功能打擾。內建情緒追蹤功能，可隨時間觀察自身心情變化，幫助你更了解情緒波動。透過標籤與分類整理日記內容，日後回顧更加方便。介面設計美觀直覺，並注重私隱保護，你的所有思緒都安全保留，適合進行感恩練習、情緒梳理或生活記錄。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-981-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-982-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-983-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-984-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-985-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-986-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Enso – Your Journal</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T19:52:37.326998+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}